# GitHub Packages for @swamidasslab/xpict
#
# Vendored today (`file:vendor/…` in package.json) so CI works without a token.
# To install from the registry instead:
#
#   @swamidasslab:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
#
# Then set dependency to `"@swamidasslab/xpict": "^0.1.1"` and export NPM_TOKEN
# (classic PAT with `read:packages`, or grant Actions access on the package).
